Discover cameras on the local network via ONVIF WS-Discovery

Usage: qam discover [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --info[=<info>]      Attempt ONVIF GetDeviceInformation (may require credentials)
      --config <path>      Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
      --timeout <timeout>  Discovery timeout [default: 3s]
  -h, --help               Print help
